lends both infrastructures into one seamless environment.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"tab-panel\" id=\"step-5\">\n      <h2>FinOps<\/h2>\n      <p>Our FinOps (Financial Operations) services provide real-time visibility into your cloud spending, helping teams make better financial decisions. We align cloud investments with business value by introducing budgeting controls, usage analytics, and automated reporting, ensuring you only pay for what you truly need.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"tab-panel\" id=\"step-6\">\n      <h2>Cloud Lifecycle Service<\/h2>\n      <p>Manage your entire cloud environment with our full-scope cloud lifecycle services. From strategic planning and infrastructure deployment to monitoring, support, and optimization, we handle every step with precision. Our approach guarantees consistent performance and evolves with your business over time.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"tab-panel\" id=\"step-7\">\n      <h2>Cloud Transformation<\/h2>\n      <p>Cloud transformation is more than just migrating systems; it's about reshaping the way your business operates. We help you modernize legacy apps, adopt cloud-first strategies, and embrace intelligent automation. This results in greater innovation, reduced costs, and a stronger foundation for digital acceleration.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<script>\n  const steps = document.querySelectorAll('.step');\n  const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-panel');\n\n  steps.forEach(step => {\n    step.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      steps.forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));\n      panels.forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));\n\n      step.classList.add('active');\n      const targetId = 'step-' + step.getAttribute('data-step');\n      document.getElementById(targetId).classList.add('active');\n    });\n  });\n<\/script>\n\n<\/body>\n<\/html>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<sec